{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sanitary Inspector","role":"Sanitary Inspector","summary":"A Sanitary Inspector works in environmental and community health, helping prevent disease by monitoring sanitation, drinking water, food hygiene, waste management, vector control, public premises, and environmental-health conditions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Sanitary Inspector works in environmental and community health, helping prevent disease by monitoring sanitation, drinking water, food hygiene, waste management, vector control, public premises, and environmental-health conditions."},{"type":"p","text":"The role is particularly relevant to municipal bodies, public-health departments, local authorities, hospitals, educational institutions, industrial organizations, and environmental-health programs."},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the direct pathway is generally a recognized Sanitary Inspector / Health Inspector / Public Health Inspector qualification or an appropriate public-health/allied-health program accepted by the recruiting authority. The broad category listed here should not be interpreted as meaning that every BPT, BOT or BMLT graduate automatically qualifies for Sanitary Inspector recruitment. Eligibility is highly notification- and employer-specific."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build environmental-health, sanitation, epidemiology and inspection skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as Sanitary Inspector / Health Inspector / Public Health Field Officer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Senior Sanitary Inspector, Public Health Inspector or supervisory roles"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Public Health Supervisor, Environmental Health Officer, municipal health adm