:"Understand relevant public-health and sanitation regulations."},{"text":"Participate in outbreak and environmental-health response activities."},{"text":"Complete practical field training in municipal/public-health environments."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recognized Sanitary/Health Inspector or Public Health qualification","Sanitary Inspector","Senior Sanitary Inspector","Public Health / Environmental Health Supervisor","Environmental Health Officer / Public Health Management"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ public-health environment, the strongest profile is a Sanitary Inspector who combines field inspection and sanitation expertise with environmental-health science, epidemiology, GIS, digital inspection systems and data-driven disease prevention."}]}]}